{"unit":3,"items":30,"pass":21,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 3","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 3 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Going up, going down</h2>\n      <p data-t=\"gx254\">Thirty questions on Unit 3 only. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>21 out of 30</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u3\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u3r101\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;14</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u3r102\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">He &hellip; the door and went out.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">opened</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">was opening</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">While I &hellip; for the lift, the lights went out.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">waited</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">was waiting</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">They &hellip; dinner when the phone rang.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">had</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">were having</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">have had</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">She &hellip; to Rome three times last year.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">flew</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">was flying</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u3r103\">Put the verb in brackets into the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>fall</i>) He <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"fell\" data-why=\"One finished action &rarr; Past Simple. <b>Fall</b> is irregular: <b>fell</b>.\"> and hurt his knee.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>listen</i>) I <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"was listening\" data-why=\"An action in progress when something interrupted it: <b>was listening</b>.\"> to music when she called.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>not see</i>) We <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"didn't see|did not see|didn&rsquo;t see|didnt see\" data-why=\"Past Simple negative: <b>didn&rsquo;t see</b> &mdash; the main verb stays plain.\"> the sign.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u3r104\">Choose the correct adverb.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">She spoke very &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">quiet</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">quietly</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">He waited &hellip; for two hours and never complained.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">calm</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">calmly</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">They both speak English &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">fluent</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">fluently</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u3r105\">Each sentence has one wrong word. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"2\" data-why=\"One short finished action takes the Past Simple: <i>I <b>fell</b> off my bike yesterday</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">I</span> <span class=\"ew\">was</span> <span class=\"ew\">falling</span> <span class=\"ew\">off</span> <span class=\"ew\">my</span> <span class=\"ew\">bike</span> <span class=\"ew\">yesterday</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"Past Continuous question: <i>What were you <b>doing</b> when it happened?</i>\"><span class=\"ew\">What</span> <span class=\"ew\">were</span> <span class=\"ew\">you</span> <span class=\"ew\">do</span> <span class=\"ew\">when</span> <span class=\"ew\">it</span> <span class=\"ew\">happened</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u3r106\">Write the sentence again so that it means the same.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">It started to rain. At that moment I was on my way home.<br>I <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"was walking home when it started to rain|was walking home\" data-why=\"The longer action goes in the Past Continuous: <b>was walking home</b> when it started to rain.\"> when it started to rain.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">He didn&rsquo;t see the step, so he fell.<br>He fell because he <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"did not see the step|didn&rsquo;t see the step|didn't see the step|didnt see the step\" data-why=\"Past Simple negative: <b>didn&rsquo;t see the step</b>.\">.</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u3r107\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 15&ndash;24</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u3r108\">Complete each sentence with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">The plane <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"took\" data-why=\"<b>Take off</b> = leave the ground and start to fly. Past: <b>took</b> off.\"> off exactly at six.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">He opened his <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"parachute\" data-why=\"A <b>parachute</b> opens like an umbrella and slows your fall.\"> at two thousand metres.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">After a twelve-hour shift she was completely <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"exhausted\" data-why=\"<b>Exhausted</b> = extremely tired, with no energy left.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">I felt <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"embarrassed\" data-why=\"<b>Embarrassed</b> = uncomfortable because other people saw you do something silly.\"> when I forgot her name in front of everyone.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">The <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"rescue\" data-why=\"A <b>rescue team</b> saves someone who is in danger.\"> team reached him in ninety seconds.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u3r109\">Choose the correct word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">He was very &hellip; before the interview, but it went well.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">nervous</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">pleased</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">guilty</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">The balloon &hellip; him to thirty-nine kilometres.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">lifted</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">dropped</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">landed</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">22</span><span class=\"body\">She is in a good &hellip; today &mdash; she has been smiling all morning.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">mood</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">behaviour</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">feeling</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u3r110\">One word in each group does not belong. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">23</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are unpleasant feelings. <b>Pleased</b> is a good one.\"><span class=\"ew\">angry</span> <span class=\"ew\">anxious</span> <span class=\"ew\">frightened</span> <span class=\"ew\">pleased</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">24</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are movements. An <b>intercom</b> is a device.\"><span class=\"ew\">climb</span> <span class=\"ew\">jump</span> <span class=\"ew\">dive</span> <span class=\"ew\">intercom</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u3r111\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 3 &middot; Function &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 25&ndash;30</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u3r112\">Choose the correct phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">25</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; what happened to me yesterday!\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">You&rsquo;ll never believe</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">You never believe</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">You don&rsquo;t believe</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">26</span><span class=\"body\">Your friend says: &ldquo;I lost my passport on the first day.&rdquo; You say&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">&ldquo;What a nightmare!&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">&ldquo;That&rsquo;s fine.&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">&ldquo;Congratulations!&rdquo;</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">27</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; , we missed the train and waited four hours.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">In the end</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">At the end</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">On the end</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u3r113\">Complete with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">28</span><span class=\"body\">Everything went wrong. What a <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"nightmare\" data-why=\"<b>What a nightmare!</b> &mdash; a strong reaction to a bad story.\">!</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">29</span><span class=\"body\">Anyway, that is all my news. Write <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"back\" data-why=\"<b>Write back soon</b> &mdash; the standard closing line of an informal email.\"> soon!</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u3r114\">Put the three parts of an informal email in the usual order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">30</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"order\" data-order=\"r1,r2,r3\">\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r2\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Guess what happened on the way to Astana&hellip;</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r1\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Dear Marat,</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r3\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Anyway, write back soon. Aisha</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}